@CentralDoSaber_HostAddress = http://localhost:5058

### Health check (self + banco + site FIAP)
GET {{CentralDoSaber_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Lista usuários
GET {{CentralDoSaber_HostAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

### Cria usuário (gera logs com traceId)
POST {{CentralDoSaber_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Maria Silva",
  "email": "maria@exemplo.com",
  "senha": "senhaSegura123",
  "dataNascimento": "2000-05-10"
}

### Atualiza usuário inexistente (404 via GlobalExceptionHandler)
PUT {{CentralDoSaber_HostAddress}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Novo Nome"
}
